/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (Standardized test scores \(SAT/ACT\) were once a core part of the University of California admissions decisions. A 2020 court ruling barred UC from considering SAT/ACT scores starting with the Fall 2021 cycle, and the policy was made permanent \(test-blind\) for the years that followed. That shift, layered on top of the COVID-19 disruption to testing access in 2020, creates a natural before/after comparison.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
